date-released: 2026-09-04
keywords:
    - voice AI
    - conversational latency
    - RTP
    - SIP
    - speech recognition
    - measurement
abstract: >-
    An instrument for measuring mouth-to-ear response latency of conversational
    voice AI systems at the RTP egress reference point: the interval from the end
    of a caller's utterance to the arrival of the system's first response audio.
    Validated to sub-millisecond bias against known programmed delays.
